@BostonDynamics  Creatures unveiled Hugo, a furry 57-joint bipedal companion robot! 🤖🐾

Founded by ex-Boston Dynamics & RAI leads, it runs the first Vision-Language-Expression (VLE) model to read the room & connect with guests across resorts and theme parks. 
#PhysicalAI

Everyone’s building robots to do the work. What about robots people actually want to spend time with?

@dynamicreatures is taking robotics into entertainment and hospitality, where personality and real-time interaction matter just as much as movement.

This could be a whole new market for robotics.

